# Theme JavaScript

Segui [docs/agents/javascript-expert.md](docs/agents/javascript-expert.md) e [docs/11-javascript.md](docs/11-javascript.md).

CE → estendi `HTMLComponent`; markup con `ref` e `on:*`; override `onScroll`/`onResize` (no listener globali manuali). File dominio PascalCase; `async/await`; no `try/catch`; eventi reattivi; fetch via helper esistenti.
